---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Vision & Roadmap — Sustainabox">

	<header class="page-hero" style="background-image: url('/images/PXL_20260619_013004398.jpg');">
		<div class="page-hero-inner">
			<span class="eyebrow">Vision &amp; Roadmap</span>
			<h1>The Vision</h1>
			<p>Where Sustainabox is going, how we'll get there, and what success looks like.</p>
		</div>
	</header>

	<section class="container content-section">
		<h2>What We're Building</h2>
		<p>SustainaBox is the trusted advisor and platform for entrepreneurs and enterprises building resilient, sustainable housing and alternative facilities. We combine enterprise-grade risk thinking with hands-on construction expertise to help you design, plan, and execute projects that survive chaos and scale impact.</p>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Three-Year Vision</h2>

		<div class="vision-timeline">
			<div class="vision-year">
				<h3>Year 1: Foundation (2025)</h3>
				<p><strong>Goal:</strong> $50K–80K revenue. Establish authority, land first clients, build product suite.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Launch consulting practice (target: 2–3 clients)</li>
					<li>Build digital product suite (cost calculator, planner, checklists)</li>
					<li>Launch first cohort-based course</li>
					<li>Build content engine (YouTube, Substack, blog)</li>
					<li>Establish thought leadership positioning</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="vision-year">
				<h3>Year 2: Scale (2026)</h3>
				<p><strong>Goal:</strong> $200K–400K revenue. Prove repeatability, scale courses and workshops.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>2–3 course cohorts (20–30 students each)</li>
					<li>Host quarterly workshops at property (4–6 per year)</li>
					<li>Build membership community to 200+ members</li>
					<li>Expand consulting to 4–5 clients annually</li>
					<li>Explore licensing opportunities (prefab design, IP)</li>
					<li>YouTube reaches 10K–50K subscribers</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="vision-year">
				<h3>Year 3: Maturity (2027)</h3>
				<p><strong>Goal:</strong> $500K–1.2M revenue. Diversified, passive income streams, ready to scale further.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>4–6 course cohorts annually (80K–150K/year)</li>
					<li>6–8 annual workshops (120K–250K/year)</li>
					<li>500+ community members (150K–200K/year recurring)</li>
					<li>Licensing deals generating passive revenue (50K–200K/year)</li>
					<li>Content monetization (50K–150K/year)</li>
					<li>Selective high-ticket consulting (50K–100K/year)</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">The Business Model Portfolio</h2>
		<p>We're not betting everything on one revenue stream. Instead, we're building complementary offerings that reinforce each other:</p>

		<div class="business-models">
			<div class="bm-row">
				<div class="bm-item">
					<h4>Consulting</h4>
					<p><strong>Revenue:</strong> $30K–150K/year</p>
					<p><strong>Role:</strong> Lead income generator. Fast to market. Builds case studies and credibility.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bm-item">
					<h4>Course (Cohort-Based)</h4>
					<p><strong>Revenue:</strong> $20K–150K/year</p>
					<p><strong>Role:</strong> Scales beyond 1:1 consulting. Higher volume, lower per-student price.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bm-item">
					<h4>Products (Digital)</h4>
					<p><strong>Revenue:</strong> $5K–20K/year</p>
					<p><strong>Role:</strong> Passive income. Lead magnet for email list. Low cost to maintain.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="bm-row">
				<div class="bm-item">
					<h4>Membership</h4>
					<p><strong>Revenue:</strong> $30K–200K/year</strong></p>
					<p><strong>Role:</strong> Recurring revenue. Ecosystem play. Ties everything together.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bm-item">
					<h4>Workshops (Property)</h4>
					<p><strong>Revenue:</strong> $80K–250K/year</p>
					<p><strong>Role:</strong> Combines learning + hospitality. Uses physical asset. Premium pricing.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bm-item">
					<h4>IP & Licensing</h4>
					<p><strong>Revenue:</strong> $50K–200K/year</p>
					<p><strong>Role:</strong> Passive income at scale. Prefab design, frameworks, methodology.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">12-Month Roadmap</h2>

		<div class="roadmap">
			<div class="milestone">
				<h4>Months 1–2: Launch</h4>
				<p>✓ Site refresh (new positioning, service pages, vision clarity)</p>
				<p>✓ Consulting intake opens (free 30-min calls)</p>
				<p>✓ Digital products live (Gumroad)</p>
				<p>✓ YouTube channel + Substack start</p>
			</div>

			<div class="milestone">
				<h4>Months 3–4: Traction</h4>
				<p>✓ Land 1–2 consulting clients ($5K–15K)</p>
				<p>✓ Course curriculum finalized, enrollment opens</p>
				<p>✓ First cohort launches (target: 15–25 students)</p>
				<p>✓ Build email list to 500+</p>
			</div>

			<div class="milestone">
				<h4>Months 5–6: Momentum</h4>
				<p>✓ First course cohort in progress</p>
				<p>✓ Plan first workshop (design + stay + meals)</p>
				<p>✓ Launch membership community (50–100 founding members)</p>
				<p>✓ Consulting pipeline: 2–3 active projects</p>
			</div>

			<div class="milestone">
				<h4>Months 7–9: Prove Model</h4>
				<p>✓ First course cohort completes, testimonials gathered</p>
				<p>✓ Host first workshop (8–12 people, $500–1000 each)</p>
				<p>✓ Second course cohort enrollment opens</p>
				<p>✓ Membership growing (100+ members, $2K–3K/mo recurring)</p>
			</div>

			<div class="milestone">
				<h4>Months 10–12: Scale</h4>
				<p>✓ Year 1 revenue target: $50K–80K</p>
				<p>✓ 2–3 course cohorts completed</p>
				<p>✓ 2–3 workshops hosted</p>
				<p>✓ Email list: 2K+</p>
				<p>✓ YouTube: 1K subscribers</p>
				<p>✓ Plan Year 2 expansion</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Success Metrics</h2>

		<div class="metrics-grid">
			<div class="metric">
				<strong>Revenue</strong>
				<p>Year 1: $50K–80K<br/>Year 2: $200K–400K<br/>Year 3: $500K–1.2M</p>
			</div>
			<div class="metric">
				<strong>Audience</strong>
				<p>Email list: 500 → 2K → 5K<br/>YouTube: 0 → 1K → 10K–50K<br/>Community: 50 → 200 → 500+</p>
			</div>
			<div class="metric">
				<strong>Offerings</strong>
				<p>Consulting: 2–3/yr → 4–5/yr<br/>Courses: 1 → 2–3 → 4–6<br/>Workshops: 0 → 1–2 → 6–8</p>
			</div>
			<div class="metric">
				<strong>Efficiency</strong>
				<p>Consulting: high touch → systemized<br/>Course: custom → repeatable<br/>Products: labor → passive</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Why This Works</h2>

		<div class="why-box">
			<h3>✓ Authentic Proof Point</h3>
			<p>We built what we teach. The property is real. Lessons are documented. This is hard to fake and builds immediate credibility.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="why-box">
			<h3>✓ Complementary Revenue Streams</h3>
			<p>Consulting funds Year 1 and builds case studies. Course scales without sacrificing 1:1 time. Products are passive. Community is recurring. No single revenue stream carries the whole business.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="why-box">
			<h3>✓ Founder Advantage</h3>
			<p>15+ years in enterprise resilience + hands-on container home build. Few people have this combination. It's defensible and differentiated.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="why-box">
			<h3>✓ Scalable Without Sacrificing Quality</h3>
			<p>Consulting stays 1:1 but course, products, and community allow leverage. We can serve more people without burning out.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="why-box">
			<h3>✓ Multiple Paths to $100K</h3>
			<p>We don't need all revenue streams to hit. Hit consulting (3–4 clients) + course (1–2 cohorts) and we're at $100K+.</p>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">The Case Study</h2>
		<p>Your property isn't just a project—it's an asset that produces multiple revenue streams:</p>
		<ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
			<li>✓ Consulting case study (proof of concept)</li>
			<li>✓ Course example (real photos, real problems, real solutions)</li>
			<li>✓ Workshop venue (learn on-property)</li>
			<li>✓ Hospitality (Airbnb, retreat model)</li>
			<li>✓ Media backdrop (YouTube, content creation)</li>
		</ul>

		<div class="next-step">
			<h3>Next Steps</h3>
			<p><strong>Month 1:</strong> Launch this site. Open consulting intake. Build Gumroad products.</p>
			<p><strong>Month 2:</strong> Land first consulting client. Record YouTube intro.</p>
			<p><strong>Month 3:</strong> First course cohort enrollment opens.</p>
			<p>The momentum builds from there.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.content-section {
		padding: 3rem 0;
	}

	.content-section h2 {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		padding-bottom: 1rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-blue);
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.content-section p {
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.vision-timeline {
		display: grid;
		gap: 2rem;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.vision-year {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.vision-year h3 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.vision-year p {
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.vision-year ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.vision-year li {
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.vision-year li::before {
		content: "→";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.business-models {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.bm-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.bm-item {
		background: white;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 6px;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.bm-item h4 {
		color: var(--color-blue);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.bm-item p {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.roadmap {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.milestone {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.milestone h4 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.milestone p {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.metrics-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.metric {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-top: 3px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.metric strong {
		color: var(--color-blue);
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.metric p {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.why-box {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.why-box h3 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.why-box p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.next-step {
		background: var(--color-navy);
		color: white;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin-top: 3rem;
	}

	.next-step h3 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.next-step p {
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		opacity: 0.95;
	}

	ul[style="list-style: none; padding: 0;"] li {
		padding: 0.5rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	ul[style="list-style: none; padding: 0;"] li::before {
		content: "✓";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-weight: 700;
	}
</style>
